"P2669283609" "Only a the most insidious Mastermind could construct such monstrosity.  Cold and relentless, these Bots obey only one voice, and will execute any order without hesitation."
// DisplayNames :
"P524637202" "Assault Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Genin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2343931460" "Genin may be the lowest ranking Ninja and only posses basic Ninjitsu skills, but they are nothing to be trifled with.  Genin are highly trained warriors and deeply devoted to their Master."
// GroupDescription :
"P1004628773" "Ninjas"
// DisplayNames :
"P2088046318" "Genin"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Jonin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3455318539" "The Jounin Ninja is a master assassins and expert swordsman. A master of stealth and shadow, few ever see them coming."
// DisplayNames :
"P83771904" "Jounin"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Oni 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2827119938" "An Oni is a powerful human-like demon warrior.  The Oni is a formidable creature who possesses the skill of a warrior and the powers of wind and fire."
// DisplayNames :
"P1268223034" "Oni"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Zombie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3522329310" "The walking dead may be slow and stupid, but wise heroes know better than to underestimate them. Even when a person survives an encounter with a zombie, he rarely escapes entirely unscathed. He will often find himself waking in the night, shuddering at the memory of a dry and lifeless touch."
// GroupDescription :
"P1849979927" "Necromancy"
// DisplayNames :
"P206380807" "Zombie"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Skeletal_Warrior 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1916322435" "Only the most battle hardened warriors filled with a lust for revenge will return as a Grave Knight.  This undead warrior may be sentient, but it has no understanding of a living world now alien to him.  It can only see its own bloodlust and thirst for vengeance. Only the most powerful Masterminds can control them."
// DisplayNames :
"P3240964949" "Grave Knight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_Pet_Lich 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3106505096" "The lich is an undead entity that, when alive, possessed many dark powers of his own.  Perhaps it was a dark wizard, or powerful arch villain.  Perhaps it was even a Necromancer.  Now it only hungers for the souls of the living, and is quite good at feeding itself."
// DisplayNames :
"P3124304184" "Lich"

