"P3872722198" "Rising Vengeance is one of the premier assassins within the Tsoo organization. Called on for only the most difficult of hits."
// GroupDescription :
"P217356865" "Tsoo"
// DisplayNames :
"P3414503472" "Rising Vengeance"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_BronzeTalon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3671760868" "One of the upper echelon of the Tsoo, Bronze Talon has never been seen without his bodyguard. Many organizations have claimed to have killed Bronze Talon, but he keeps showing back up, almost as if by magic."
// DisplayNames :
"P295115467" "Bronze Talon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_SteveMutombo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P26101439" "Known as 'Mute' to the members of the Family here in St. Martial, Steve Mutombo has done more time in the Zig than any other member of the Family. He routinely takes the fall for others, never flipping on his comrades."
// GroupDescription :
"P4042293109" "The Family"
// DisplayNames :
"P1919112735" "Steve "Mute" Mutombo"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_ConcreteBill 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1907828253" "Concrete' Bill is an enforcer for the Family. He got his nickname for the sheer amount of people he gave concrete shoes to before dropping them into the harbors of St. Martial. He's entrusted with delivering the protection money collected from the businesses of St. Martial."
// DisplayNames :
"P1364271947" "Concrete Bill"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GenericVillains_SgtSchorr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
