// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Civilians_Ms_MaeMae_van_Whooters 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3410622642" "Though initially cast for her physical assets in a number of 1960's 'rebellious teenager' movies, Maemae van Whooters soon cultivated a respectable career by alternating serious roles with B-movie fare to avoid typecasting. Her star fell in the late 1970s when changing standards of beauty in Hollywood made it harder for her to get major roles. Instead of giving up, she began to concentrate on serious parts in foreign films, earning high praise in Europe with several costume dramas through the 1980s. She quit acting in the mid 1990s to become a writer, though she will still appear on camera to promote children's charities and environmental organizations."
// DisplayClassName :
"P632638354" "as Ms Chesterfield"
// GroupDescription :
"P3205951783" "Actress"
// DisplayNames :
"P872149023" "Maemae van Whooters"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Civilians_MissFrancine_NPC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1035569974" "Miss Francine is a plucky young teacher from Paragon City who came to the Rogue Isles to teach the underpriveliged. Somehow her sweet demeanor and good intentions caught the attention of several members of the Freakshow, who were so astounded that they couldn't bully her, decided to try doing what she said. She has since started an underground school dedicated to teaching and rehabilitating members of the normally violent street gang."
// GroupDescription :
"P4236842470" "Idealistic Teacher"
// DisplayNames :
"P1643973891" "Miss Francine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Civilians_Mueller_NPC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3235541194" "Mueller is the man with the plan... or the man with the money. However you look at it, he's paying you for a job and that's all you really need or want to know."
