// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3524697265" "Field Agent Keith Nance works for S.A.M., a supposed branch of the FBSA responsible for monitoring superpowered activities throughout the nation.  It's a very rare thing to see one of these agents in the field; usually it means they're performing some type of high level investigation."
// DisplayClassName :
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :

