// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Proton 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3102236243" "A refugee from another dimension and time, Proton seeks a way back home to his true world.  The clone of the son of his world's Manticore and Sister Psyche, Proton was raised by his 'uncle' Positron after their untimely death.  Wearing Positron's final armor design, Proton faced down the combined might of the Arachnos Empire during the world's most desperate moment and lost.  Ripped through time and space, Proton now seeks to defend Paragon City from Arachnos before it's too late for this world.  And perhaps along the way, he'll be able to use his superior intellect from a future that never was to return to his home."
// GroupDescription :
"P188707243" "Shining Stars"
// DisplayNames :
"P1183581717" "Proton"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Proton_Mid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4280292693" "Proton once believed he was a refugee from another dimension and time. He claimed to be the clone of Manticore and Sister Psyche and raised by Positron. However, this outrageous story proved to be false, a reality that was crafted by Praetor Tilman. Proton was, in reality, an unknowin mole planted by the Praetorians to try to attack Primal Earth. Tilman's control over Proton was broken, and now he seeks to carve out a new life and path for himself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Grym 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2822415777" "Grym endured the Trials of Confluence for all 7 years, emerging as the Lord Guardian until the Trials begin once again.  Taking his right of first choosing, he selected Paragon City as his protectorate and crossed the veil into the World of Shape to install himself as the City's Grim."
// DisplayNames :
"P3171736828" "Grym"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Grym_Mid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Dillo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1595902427" "One of the Maaxigada'arzildilo, aliens from a distant solar system , "Dillo" has traveled to Earth to warn the Humans of the impending threat of the Shivans.  Dillo's homeworld was destroyed centuries by a devastating assault by the Shivans leaving him and his people as space-faring nomads.  Upon finding radio waves  sent from Earth, Dillo's people have sent him as a scout to warn the Humans of dangers of Shivans or to return with sad news of another race of lifeforms annihilated by these unstoppable devastators.  Having arrived just as the invasion began, Dillo chose to stay and help the Earthlings fight off the menace instead of potentially luring them back to his own people."
// DisplayNames :
"P2029509435" "Dillo"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Twinshot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P209800476" "Twinshot wandered around the nation for several years after being discharged from the military, acting as a hired gun to whoever would hire her. After some time, she got over her disillusionment and remembered why she joined the military to begin with. She began fighting for 'what was right.' Working with Proton, they fought together to bring justice to Paragon City. Recently she's added Dillo and Flambeaux to the mix. Twinshot is always on the lookout for a fresh face who wants to make a difference."
// DisplayNames :
"P507186409" "Twinshot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Twinshot_Mid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Flambeaux 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3971731157" "Flambeaux is a fiery-haired hero who developed a process to turn her body energies into biochemical fire she can project at her enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P4293359284" "Flambeaux"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Dillo_Sig3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Proton_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_H_Grym_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
