// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Zephyr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P52534034" "Zephyr has been around for quite a while, zipping around the skies for generations.  Having become rather bored due to the advent of increased navigation technology and sturdier construction material used in buildings, Zephyr has taken a corporeal form recently.  Spending time among Paragon City, he would soon move onto the Rogue Isles where he found people were far more willing to destroy things for no good reason.  And for Zephyr, that's one heck of a lot of fun."
// GroupDescription :
"P1970429078" "Hearts of Darkness"
// DisplayNames :
"P537434788" "Zephyr"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Zephyr_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Omnicore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P997119067" "Omnicore possesses neither patience nor tolerance towards anything that does not revolve around her quest for the perfect weapon.  Very little is known about her, which is more due to her being nose-down into her work and not talking to others than any other mysterious reasons.  She has spent years working on creating the perfect weapon, incorporating parts of her own body to increase power throughput to the device.  If one looks closely, they might notice that she has added a great deal of her body parts to make this happen perhaps maybe even all of them."
// DisplayNames :
"P2481652552" "Omnicore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_DrGraves 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1335913905" "Todd Graves has lived a life of irony that some might find impossible to bear.  A prominent surgeon who had a talent for successful organ transplants, Dr. Graves would contract a flesh-eating virus that attacked his largest organ: his skin.  Introducing an DNA-altered strain of the virus to another skin 'organ', he managed to successfully complete the first ever full body skin transplant upon his own person.  Additionally, the two viruses wound up counteracting each other, creating another that benignly caused all cells within his body to stop deteriorating.  Thus, Dr. Graves managed to discover immortality, albeit at a high cost.  Although his cells no longer age and 'die', once damaged, they can no longer be healed, but new parts CAN be transplanted onto his body to 'repair' the cell damage.  Shunned by the medical community as a modern-day Frankenstein and Monster, Dr. Graves has fled to the Rogue Isles to continue his research and draw from a supply of never-to-be-missed body parts."
// DisplayNames :
"P450944924" "Dr. Graves"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Crosscut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2655249985" "Where he came from, no one knows. Who he is, not even he remembers. What he has planned, only the soon-to-be dead learn.  Not much of a conversationalist, Crosscut likes to talk with his blades.  And usually, that's the last thing one hears."
// DisplayNames :
"P3358375528" "Crosscut"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Dollface 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2682449889" "The least dangerous appearing of all the candidates, Dollface manages to use her looks to her advantage.  Everyone involved knows that when the time comes, she'll be the easiest to 'do away with'."
// DisplayNames :
"P2997870180" "Dollface"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Dollface_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - OnGoingTrainingCharacters_V_Dollface_Soul 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3413389211" "From a distance, the Storm Elementals are a beautiful sight. At close range, however, they're a serious threat. Their Endurance-draining attacks can cripple their foes. The most powerful Storm Elementals are able to hold their victims in an ionic embrace, rendering them defenseless."
// DisplayNames :
"P1170186089" "Dollface's Soul"

