// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Icecap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3333474512" "Orphaned in the bitter-cold mountains of Nepal this young man made a pact with the harsh spirits of frost and ice to bring their pain wherever he walked."
// GroupDescription :
"P1189903176" "Rogue Isles Villains"
// DisplayNames :
"P764259848" "Icecap"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Blood_Thorn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2286204104" "Born in the Brazilian rainforest where the greed from ranchers had taken her home and family at a young age. She decided that the human race needed to be destroyed before they destroy the earth completely."
// DisplayNames :
"P464849231" "Blood Thorn"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Comatorium 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P97753448" "A shut in for most of his life, Comatorium went crazy when his apartment burnt down with his mother in it. He made the decision after the fire that everyone around him had to pay for his loss."
// DisplayNames :
"P525913918" "Comatorium"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Martial_Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3534198151" "Once a force to be reckoned within the Freedom Corps organization. Martial Gloom went insane after seeing innocent bystanders die in a fire fight and vowed to take the Freedom Corps down himself."
// DisplayNames :
"P2973485039" "Martial Gloom"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Pyra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2340372461" "Once a beauty queen pageant winner that lost her looks when the building a pageant she was in burnt down. She vowed to make everyone suffer the way that she did that fateful day of the fire."
// DisplayNames :
"P2530593243" "Pyra"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Echidna 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2069114079" "Echidna has been cursed with a monstrous visage all her life. With few options open to her she took up the persona of the horrific Greek goddess and unleashed her fury on the unsuspecting world."
// DisplayNames :
"P1682311242" "Echidna"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Towering_Inferno 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3767411401" "A colossus of modern technology, the Towering Inferno sets all who oppose him ablaze!"
// DisplayNames :
"P524839340" "Towering Inferno"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Ayame_Higarashi 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P429283709" "Born into a major crime family in Japan, Ayame has trained hard to become the ultimate assassin, with the hopes of surpassing even Silent Blade and Silver Mantis."
// DisplayNames :
"P59687272" "Ayame Higarashi"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Double_Tap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3041321039" "A man obsessed with weaponry and guns whose sole purpose in life was to be a vigilante. A victim of mistaken identity he was banished to the dark side of the law and stayed there."
// DisplayNames :
"P3323491957" "Double Tap"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Miss_Thystle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P605476580" "This woman was just born into the wrong family. Her parents being her role model she decided that she wanted it all in life, without the hassle of working for it. Miss Thysle doesn't care how she gets what she wants, just as long as she gets it."
// DisplayNames :
"P3401303998" "Miss Thystle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Stardusk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P857991752" "With a tainted soul as dark and twisted as a dying star, this villain warps and weakens any who stand in her way."
// DisplayNames :
"P3726305326" "Stardusk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Mangle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P686854706" "Mangle was an unwilling attraction for a traveling freak show, but the chains couldn't contain his fury forever. Once free he waited in the shadows to repay his captors' 'kindness' with blood."
// DisplayNames :
"P3299281413" "Mangle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Giga_Watts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P98436110" "Giga Watts is a cyborg, developed by a resident scientist in Cap au Diable. After many months of testing, Giga learned that he is capable of self-control, and has since abandoned his maker. Giga seeks to join Arachnos, by any means necessary."
// DisplayNames :
"P1197570000" "Giga Watts"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Savage_Siren 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2552647102" "Savage Siren once looked up to Paragon City's heroes, until the day of the Rikti War, when one of the heroes hurled a Rikti Drone into her parent's apartment, killing them instantly. Siren has vowed to destroy the Freedom Phalanx, and is seeking to join Arachnos to help in their conquest."
// DisplayNames :
"P3376532116" "Savage Siren"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Shock_Treatment 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1015746110" "A demented doctor and one too many sessions of shock therapy left this unstable girl with a permanent charge. Now she walks free cackling in delight as she gives the world a taste of her torment!"
// DisplayNames :
"P1101862320" "Shock Treatment"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Hollow_Point 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3530463385" "Forgotten by his unit and left for dead behind enemy lines, for Hollow Point escaping from that hell was only the beginning of the war. One by one he is making those who abandoned him realize the scope of their mistake."
// DisplayNames :
"P1760854376" "Hollow Point"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Burning_Daemon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3428105282" "There is nothing human about this creature. Summoned from the darkest pits, Burning Daemon seeks nothing but to cause havoc and create chaos. Many villain groups have attempted to recruit him to control his power, however he has expressed no interest in any of their petty mortal dealings."
// DisplayNames :
"P2225582105" "Burning Daemon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Silent_Blade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P556154950" "Trained from birth to be the perfect killer, she has no name, no family and no compunctions about what she does."
// DisplayNames :
"P989027405" "Silent Blade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Critical_Mass 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P794774832" "A giant of a man, Critical Mass likes to take on his opponents in close combat. He dons a heavy suit of armor and unleashes a torrent of energy with every strike."
// DisplayNames :
"P3281925444" "Critical Mass"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Fallen_From_Grace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2562447838" "Darius was once considered akin to the angels, however that all was brought to a halt when he was abducted by Arachnos, and transformed into the psychotic creature he is today. Arachnos scientists removed his eyes, but later imbued him with the power of fire, and unleashed upon the world to cause destruction."
// DisplayNames :
"P3917181570" "Fallen From Grace"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Contemptress 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P672511398" "Contemptress is the girl who is as stunning as she is malevolent. She knows she's gorgeous, uses it to her advantage, and feels everything (including the law) is beneath her. This is NOT the girl you want to ask to dance at a club."
// DisplayNames :
"P2857092304" "Contemptress"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Misadventure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2592466387" "Misadventure is just a girl with a lot of bad luck. She has accepted this as her fate and uses it to further her criminal career."
// DisplayNames :
"P2607971574" "Misadventure"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Dr_Eva_Lone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3369790788" "Dr. Lone never did well in academics. She cheated her way through medical school, and when she found the public sector actually expected results, turned her attentions to mad science. Dr. Lone has never invented anything though, she only steals inventions from others who are far more creative than she is."
// DisplayNames :
"P2245554711" "Dr. Eva Lone"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Comrade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P825819422" "A relic of the Cold War, the Soviet soldier who goes by the name of Comrade is a Killer-For-Hire. If you need someone to disappear forever, Comrade will do the deed, for the right price."
// DisplayNames :
"P3303361693" "Comrade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Bad_Penny 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1019571915" "When a Circle of Thorns ritual in Perez Park accidentally enchanted a long forgotten coin, Bad Penny was born. His mean disposition came from many years trapped in coin jars, change trays, and the fact that he could no longer be used to even purchase a gumball."
// DisplayNames :
"P3598472107" "Bad Penny"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Sardonic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1102781393" "Always a troublemaker, Sardonic often finds himself on the wrong side of the law. He is physically incapable of keeping his acerbic sarcasm to himself and tends to make bad situations worse."
// DisplayNames :
"P4170903593" "Sardonic"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Pyrelord 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P576760795" "Pyrelord has always been obsessed with death and fire. Every chance he gets, he uses his powers to create chaos and mayhem, watching the flames of destruction with eery fascination."
// DisplayNames :
"P996251443" "Pyrelord"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_Dark_Sabaoth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4167988923" "A former angel who was stripped not only of his divinity, but his entire name as well. He now roams the Earth as Dark Sabaoth, building a new name for himself, and carving out his own place in history."
// DisplayNames :
"P4133120393" "Dark Sabaoth"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RogueIslesVillains_The_Lawyer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P888744537" "The Lawyer"

