// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_Maelstrom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P178852331" "Eddie 'Maelstrom' Polstra received his nickname due to the device on his chest that keeps him alive. His background as a soldier has given Maelstrom a strong sense of loyalty, but only to those who are willing to trust him back. What exactly Maelstrom is after is a mystery to all but him, though his determination will surely see his goals become a reality one day."
// DisplayNames :
"P2937161695" "Maelstrom"

