"P2853749724" "The daughter of the original Desdemona, Eve Salvatore was destined to take up her mother's persona and pursue a life of crime. However, hers is a life of choices, and even the Arachnos Fortunatas can't predict her destiny accurately. As a demon summoning Mastermind she has the power to bend the wills of infernal entities to that of her own, a power that she has used to great effect in ridding the world of anyone who dared stand in her way."
// DisplayNames :
"P2840011673" "Desdemona"

