// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_Leon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1288256697" "Leon is a moderately experienced hero of Paragon City and has spent most of his time fighting against the Council. He has become hardened by what he has seen, and fights with a cold brutality not often seen in licensed heroes."
// GroupDescription :
"P3265828882" "Paragon City Hero"
// DisplayNames :
"P4143254117" "Leon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_SunXiong 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P535744162" "Sun Xiong is the son of Pha Xiong, the ancient martial arts master who taught Tub Ci his technique of applying mystical tattoos. Sun Xiong is also a powerful martial artist, and retains a loyal following within the Tsoo."
// GroupDescription :
"P3093288039" "The Tsoo"
// DisplayNames :
"P2955789867" "Sun Xiong"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_MartinHenri 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2283154506" "Martin Henri is the leader of the ragtag group of anti-technology cultists known as the Luddites. His mad hatred for all things created by modern science is his only passion, and it is this devotion that has drawn followers to his cause. Whatever anyone says about Martin Henri and his Luddites, it is clear that he is a true believer in his own cause."
// GroupDescription :
"P2663886055" "Luddites"
// DisplayNames :
"P124012528" "Martin Henri"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_BaronVordo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2555558417" "Baron Zukor remains a mystery to the Rogue Isles. His name does not carry weight with Arachnos, nor with the people on the streets. As far as anyone knows, he is a newcomer... but for all that, he has gained influence among the Destined Ones at an astonishing rate. His true motives remain unclear, for now."
// GroupDescription :
"P4258033614" "The Redeemer"
// DisplayNames :
"P2411898412" "Baron Vordo"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_LauraLockhart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1688427625" "Laura Lockhart is a military deprogrammer that specializes in countering 5th Column propaganda. She is currently working alongside the Paragon City Police Department, trying to stifle the recent surge in 5th Column activity in the Steel Canyon district."
// GroupDescription :
"P3269038641" "U.N. Security Forces"
// DisplayNames :
"P1363799127" "Laura Lockhart"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RoguesGallery_LowLevel_GrahamEaston 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3330693533" "Graham Easton is the curator of the Paragon International Art Museum in Steel Canyon. He takes his work seriously, but is plagued with constant fear of the local criminal element. As it turns out, his fears are often justified."
// GroupDescription :
"P2539414870" "Museum Curator"
// DisplayNames :
"P33614748" "Graham Easton"
